  "description": "A simplified, modern .NET client library for Azure Table Storage with built-in error handling and intuitive APIs. This library provides an easy-to-use wrapper around Azure.Data.Tables SDK with comprehensive entity operations, flexible querying with OData filters, batch transactions, and type-safe generic support. Perfect for NoSQL data storage scenarios requiring schema-less data with partition and row key indexing. Supports full CRUD operations, partition-based queries, optimistic concurrency with ETags, and atomic batch transactions. Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0+, .NET 7, 8, and 9. Ideal for cloud-native applications, microservices, and distributed systems requiring fast, scalable NoSQL storage with Azure integration.",
